WEBVTT

00:07:28.472 --> 00:07:31.204
to su moji baka i deka, uzgred,

00:07:31.228 --> 00:07:32.943
oni su me othranili,

00:07:32.967 --> 00:07:34.323
a eno i mene -

00:07:34.347 --> 00:07:35.348
(Smeh)

00:07:35.372 --> 00:07:40.758
(Aplauz)

00:07:40.758 --> 00:07:43.731
Dakle, smeštan sam u privatne avione,
leteo sam širom sveta,

00:07:43.731 --> 00:07:45.700
pa opet nije bilo lako

00:07:45.724 --> 00:07:48.796
jer sam povremeno bio beskućnik,

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:50.182
na mene su pljuvali,

00:07:50.206 --> 00:07:52.216
bio sam zlostavljan, nekad svakodnevno,

00:07:52.216 --> 00:07:54.178
podvrgnut maltretiranju
celog svog života,

00:07:54.178 --> 00:07:56.494
odbačen od strane nebrojeno mnogo ljudi,

00:07:56.518 --> 00:07:58.404
i bio sam izboden.

00:07:58.428 --> 00:08:00.278
Ali ono što je najviše bolelo